<title>CROATIA: Croatia September trade deficit widens to $312 mln.</title>
<headline>Croatia September trade deficit widens to $312 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MERCHANDISE TRADE    SEPTEMBER    AUGUST     SEPT '95</p>
<p> Balance (million USD)	    -312	  -219	  -134</p>
<p> Exports				 275	   369	   555</p>
<p> Imports				 587	   588	   689</p>
<p>NOTE -- September exports shrank 25.4 percent from August and were halved from September last year. Imports were 0.1-percent lower than a month earlier and down 4.6 percent from a year ago. -- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
